								<tr style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
									<td class="content-block" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 20px;" valign="top">
										Hope all is well and you're gearing up for a huge rest of 2020! I wanted to share with you some of the amazing videos, webinars, eBooks and articles that EverQuote has published in our on-going efforts to become your "go-to" source for insurance agent-focused content.
<br>
									<br>
<b><u>Videos</u>:</b><br>
<b>Visit <a href="https://vimeo.com/everquotepro">EverQuote’s Vimeo page</a> for new video content including best practice videos, testimonials and webinar recordings. Here are a few examples of what’s available:</b><br>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://vimeo.com/386289088">EverQuote Best Practices: Overcoming Objections</a>: join EverQuote Senior Customer Success Manager Randi Alvarado as she walks you through how to overcome common objections that arise when working insurance leads</li>
<li><a href="https://vimeo.com/351046153">Ted Todd Insurance – EverQuote Testimonial</a></li>
<li><a href="https://vimeo.com/386291524">EverQuote Pro Platform: Tips & Best Practice Guide</a>: EverQuote Business Consultant Todd Badolato walks you through the EverQuote Pro platform, sharing tips and best practices to help set you up for success.</li>
<li><a href="https://vimeo.com/393784983">Webinar: “Developing Team Members into Rock Stars” with Heather Powell</a>: Top agent Heather Powell describes her process for recruiting (and retaining) top talent and some of the major lessons she’s learned along the way.</li></ul>
<b><u>eBooks</u>:<br>
You can find a range of valuable content on our <a href="https://resources.everquote.com/">Resources page</a>, where we regularly publish new eBooks, white papers and guides.</b>
<ul>
<li> <a href="https://go.everquote.com/sales-best-practices">EverQuote Sales Best Practices</a> – use this guide to help align your sales processes with what the data shows are the most effective ways to work inbound insurance leads and warm transfer calls</li>
<li><a href="https://go.everquote.com/10-things-every-agent-should-be-doing">10 Things Every Agent Should Be Doing (But That Most Aren't)</a> – use this guide to help align your sales and agency management processes with what top insurance agents are already doing</li>
<li><a href="https://go.everquote.com/4-example-scripts-to-help-you-handle-consumer-objections">4 Example Scripts To Help You Handle Consumer Objections</a> – use this guide to help you address four common objections agents face on insurance sales calls</li>
<li><a href="https://go.everquote.com/social-media-playbook-for-insurance-agents">The Ultimate Social Media Playbook For Insurance Agents</a> - Learn how to implement a proven, effective social media marketing strategy for your agency in this free playbook.</li></ul>
<b><u>Blog</u>:<br>
Visit the EverQuote blog for regularly updated, agent-focused content, including articles like:</b>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://learn.everquote.com/insurance-lead-objections">“I never asked for a quote!” How to Turn Around Negative Sales Conversations & Insurance Lead Objections</a></li>
<li><a href="https://learn.everquote.com/insurance-sales-tips">How To Sell Insurance When Your Carrier's Rates Are High</a></li>
<li><a href="https://learn.everquote.com/insurance-agent-mistakes">Six Insurance Agents Share Their Worst Mistakes</a></li>
<li><a href="https://learn.everquote.com/customer-retention-in-insurance-industry">12 Customer Retention Strategies In The Insurance Industry</a></li>
</ul>
Please don’t hesitate to reach out directly if you have any questions – (844) 707-8800.
